  "studyExpTitle": "About the study",
  "studyExpBody": "This study measures gut motility (the movement of food through the digestive system) in people with Phelan-McDermid Syndrome using a novel blue meal test. It involves eating blue muffins and tracking bowel movements to determine transit time, which is the duration it takes for food to move through the digestive system, from consumption to excretion. The study will measure transit time twice using the blue muffins and this mobile app.",
  "studyExpBodyCont": "During the study, you will be asked to report various gastrointestinal (GI) signs and symptoms using this app. While bowel movements are the primary focus of the study, we highly encourage you to track all relevant information, including:",
  "studyBodySymptomOne": "Meal times (not a symptom, but important for context)",
  "studyBodySymptomTwo": "Pain",
  "studyBodySymptomThree": "Reflux",
  "studyBodySymptomFour": "Neurological behavior",
  "studyEligibilityTitle": "Eligibility",
  "studyEligibilityParticipants": "Participants must:",
  "studyEligibilityOne": "Have Phelan-McDermid Syndrome",
  "studyEligibilityTwo": "Be 4 years of age or older",
  "studyEligibilityThree": "Live in the United States",
  "studyEligibilityFour": "Have an English-speaking caregiver to track symptoms",
  "studyFlowTitle": "Study Flow",
  "studyFlowDesc": "The study consists of a pre-study phase, preparation, and two transit time measurements:",
  "studyFlowPreStudy": "Pre-Study:",
  "studyFlowPreStudyOne": "Complete the onboarding questionnaire",
  "studyFlowPreStudyTwo": "Track GI symptoms, using this app, for at least 7 days before starting Step 1 (eating the blue meal).",
  "studyFlowPrepTitle": "Preparation:",
  "studyFlowPrepOne": "You will receive 4 blue muffins. Store them in the freezer until ready to use.",
  "studyFlowPrepTwo": "Muffins contain gluten-free flour, protein powder, egg whites, jam, sugar, and blue food coloring.",
  "studyFlowStepOneTitle": "Step 1: Eat Blue Meal (Transit Time 1)",
  "studyFlowStepOnePartOne": "After a 6-8 hour overnight fast, feed the participant 2 blue muffins.",
  "studyFlowStepOnePartTwo": "Start the in-app timer when they begin eating. Stop when they finish. This records the muffin eating time.",
  "studyFlowStepTwoTitle": "Step 2: Record Bowel Movements (Transit Time 1)",
  "studyFlowStepTwoPartOne": "After the blue meal, record all bowel movements (BMs).",
  "studyFlowStepTwoPartTwo": "Note the color, consistency, and any other symptoms for each BM.",
  "studyFlowStepTwoPartThree": "Continue until a brown BM occurs after a blue one.",
  "studyFlowBetweenStepTwoStepThree": "Between Step 2 & Step 3:",
  "studyFlowBetweenStepTwoStepThreeDesc": "Wait 7 days after completing steps 1 and 2 before staring Step 3.",
  "studyFlowStepThreeTitle": "Step 3: Eat Blue Meal (Transit Time 2)",
  "studyFlowStepThreeDesc": "As in Step 1, after a 6-8 hour overnight fast, feed the participant the remaining 2 blue muffins. Again, start the in-app timer when they begin eating and stop when they finish to record eating time.",
  "studyFlowStepFourTitle": "Step 4: Record Bowel Movements (Transit Time 2)",
  "studyFlowStepFourDesc": "As in Step 2, after the second blue meal, record all bowel movements (BMs). Continue to note the color, consistency, and any other symptoms for each BM. Record until a brown BM occurs following a blue one.",
  "studyFlowComplete": "After completing Step 4, your participation is complete!",
