  "studyStepTwoExplanationPartTwoDetailTwo": "Fill in the required information, including the presence or absence of blue-green color",
  "studyStepTwoExplanationColorExp": "Continue recording all BMs, even if not blue-green. After the first blue-green BM, keep tracking until a non-blue BM occurs. The system will automatically complete Step 2 once you record a non-blue BM after a blue-green one.",
